OL,3,GNEWSAWoman's leg amputated after being
OL,4,Ahit by car as she loaded shopping
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman had to have her leg amputated
OL,7,Fafter she was hit by a car as she
OL,8,Floaded shopping into her vehicle
OL,9,Foutside a convenience store, a court
OL,10,Fhas heard.
OL,12,FJedburgh Sheriff Court was told the
OL,13,Fwoman suffered life-changing injuries
OL,14,Fafter Christine Thomson drove into her
OL,15,Foutside the Co-op in Coldstream.
OL,17,FThomson, 89, of Leitholm, pleaded
OL,18,Fguilty to a charge of causing serious
OL,19,Finjury by careless driving on 23
OL,20,FNovember last year.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,428,420,260,160,0,100
