OL,3,GNEWSAWoman's leg amputated after being
OL,4,Ahit by car as she loaded shopping
OL,5,
OL,6,FSheriff Robert Fife said no sentence
OL,7,Fcould compensate the victim for the
OL,8,Floss of her leg and disqualified
OL,9,FThomson from driving for 40 months. She
OL,10,Fwas also fined #750 with a #40 victim
OL,11,Fsurcharge.
